        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/b77776/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-16T21:57:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is in the rules clarification pdf on page 1 . . .</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>destroying a card before it’s finished</p><p>when a card is destroyed before it can finish its effect, any remaining effect is cancelled.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Doesn't this include these situations?</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
