        "created_at": "2014-04-16T22:36:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No, because the card effect specifically says \"until the start of your turn\" or similar.&nbsp;</p><p>Other effects aren't dependent on timing like that, so they go away when the card is destroyed.&nbsp;</p>",
