        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-16T22:37:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No, because it's not a card remaining in play that's providing the buff. In the case of Inspiring presence, that would be the case; however, it's a singular, activated ability that lasts for a specific amount of time. It specifically lasts until the start of his next turn, and is no longer considered to be the source of the damage increase.</p>",
